To gain access to Jenkins, type localhost:[Port Number] in your browser:

When doing ssh_tunneling,do port-forwarding the same port that the victim host, because when upgrading to webserver, 
(if you don't port forward the sameport, webserver is not fully updated).

#ssh -L 3000:127.0.0.1:3000 frok_donky@10.10.11.6

